  "commissioning_scanHelpDirect": "The gateway scans nearby PTUs and sends the list to the phone over Bluetooth. One-to-one mode: the strongest one is selected automatically. RSSI is the gateway-to-PTU signal; unconnected devices show the scan value. \"Last\" means paused or stale; \"Cached\" means the firmware gave no read time. Firmware 1.7.5+ measures during setup; RSSI — means no valid reading yet.",
